@baseUrl = https://api.sleeper.app/v1
@resolverBaseUrl = https://fantasy-gmassistant-middleware.vercel.app
@mcpUrl = https://fantasy-gmassistant-middleware.vercel.app/mcp
@username = HenrykManente
@userId = 1050514781800734720
@season = 2026
@leagueId = 1389353930927927296

### Descobrir a temporada e a semana atuais da NFL
GET {{baseUrl}}/state/nfl
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário por username
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{username}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário por user_id
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar ligas NFL do usuário na temporada
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/{{userId}}/leagues/nfl/{{season}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar detalhes da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar rosters da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}/rosters
Accept: application/json

### Listar membros da liga
GET {{baseUrl}}/league/{{leagueId}}/users
Accept: application/json

### Resolver somente os player_ids solicitados pelo middleware compacto
POST {{resolverBaseUrl}}/players/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player_ids": ["11604", "11618", "12469"]
}

### Inicializar uma conexão MCP Streamable HTTP
POST {{mcpUrl}}
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "manual-http-test",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}
